    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_20061211.0367\n\nLONDON, Dec 11 , 2006, 2006\n\nHammers sack Pardew\n\n\n\n\nStruggling English Premiership side West Ham on Monday sacked manager Alan Pardew.\n\nThe club are in 18th place in the Premiership after Saturday's 4-0 thrashing at Bolton with only three points separating them from bottom club Watford.\n\nThe Hammers have lost five of their last six Premiership games including both matches since Icelandic businessman Eggert Magnusson became chairman a week ago.",
